    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Social responsibility does not mean lower profitability, as the returns on social index funds have shown."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Some consumers will buy a product no matter what. However, there are other consumers who only purchase from companies they feel are ethically sound and invested in environmental protections, which is why social responsibility does not always result in lower profits."
    }
   ],
